      "content": "yeah i get that, but \"small steps\" feel like trying to empty the ocean with a spoon. everything is just so loud and heavy all the time. i'm just so done with the struggle. honestly, sometimes i think the most logical thing would just be to stop. to just... not have to deal with any of it anymore. it feels like the only way to actually get some silence is to just exit the loop entirely. does that sound insane?",
